The membership of the LLG agreed that after 2007, annual meetings would be held by email.  The minutes are available to members in the [http://mail.lojban.org/mailman/private/llg-members|archives].

* 2013: Meeting conducted via llg-members from January 19 to March 21, 2014 (summary forthcoming)
* 2012: Meeting conducted via llg-members from October 26 - December 11, 2012 (summary forthcoming)
* 2011: Meeting conducted via llg-members from October 9 - November 14, 2011 (summary forthcoming)
* 2010: ((LLG Meeting Topics 2010|Annual Meeting)) (proposed agenda only, no record of proceedings)
